  "details": "by setting up a camera rendering to a render texture with the color format set to \"ARGB Float\" it will crash the game when the camera sees a vrc portal. \n\nit is very constant and only crashed when the vrc portals are seen so far. \n\nthis has only been tested in a world environment and has not been tested on an avatar with a camera attached.\n\nthe error.log says \"VRChat.exe caused an Access Violation\" i can send error logs but since its easy to recreate you should be able to test it locally.",
